&lt;p&gt;As a Crypto Onchain Attorney, you will serve as product counsel for Robinhood&#39;s onchain products. You&#39;ll advise Product and Engineering teams on legal and regulatory considerations from early design through launch, and help structure go-to-market strategy across multiple jurisdictions. You will work closely with business partners throughout the Crypto organization to keep legal strategy consistent across the onchain product suite. This role has immediate, visible impact: you&#39;ll help shape how Robinhood develops onchain finance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
