&lt;p&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world&#39;s biggest financial problems. We&#39;re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn&#39;t a place for complacency, it&#39;s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We&#39;re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Robinhood&#39;s International team owns the full international product experience, bringing investing, trading, and crypto to customers in the EU, UK, Canada, Singapore, and beyond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Product Designer, you&#39;ll help shape how customers around the world experience our products for the first time. You&#39;ll design onboarding, trading, and money movement experiences that hold up across currencies, languages, and regulatory environments, while staying true to the craft and clarity Robinhood is known for.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design at Robinhood is AI-first. This role is for someone who already uses AI as a core part of how they think, explore, and execute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Menlo Park, CA and New York, NY office(s), with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design key features such as onboarding, trading, crypto, and money movement for one or more of Robinhood&#39;s international markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, engineering, legal, and compliance to navigate market-specific nuances without compromising a cohesive, high-quality experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring clarity to complexity by simplifying cross-border and multi-currency concepts into interfaces that feel simple and local.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to explore ideas, catch edge cases, and prototype quickly, while you drive the quality and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set direction and keep projects moving in markets with little existing precedent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of product design experience and a strong portfolio showing end-to-end ownership of complex consumer products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular use of AI in your design process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in global markets and cross-border financial products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with legal, compliance, and cross-functional partners in a regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong systems thinking, balancing consistency with Robinhood&#39;s core product against local market needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bias for action: able to find the next step and move forward through ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenging, high-impact work to grow your career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance driven compensation with multipliers for outsized impact, bonus programs, equity ownership, and 401(k) matching&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Best in class benefits to fuel your work, including 100% paid health insurance for employees with 90% coverage for dependents&lt;/li&gt;
