&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1229&quot;&gt;The Android team’s mission is to redefine how millions of users engage with their finances. We&#39;re focused on delivering intuitive, scalable, and inclusive mobile experiences that empower our customers to build better financial futures. We collaborate closely with Product, Design, and Backend Engineering to ensure every interaction on Android reflects quality, performance, and care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Crypto expansion team &lt;/strong&gt;is building Robinhood products for new regions, extending crypto and adjacent financial experiences to customers around the world. The team owns all critical parts of the app across onboarding, funding, account setup, trading product integrations, and platform capabilities required to operate in new jurisdictions. This team sits at the intersection of building an internationalization platform and region specific product execution, to help Robinhood be successful in new markets. Recent work in expansion effort has included Canada, Europe launches with multi-currency wallet capabilities, local funding rails, translations infrastructure, and new onboarding experiences for each region&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Android Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the Crypto Expansions team, you’ll help launch Robinhood’s crypto and adjacent financial products in new regions by building critical Android experiences end to end. You’ll work across onboarding, local funding rails, account setup, multi-currency wallet capabilities, trading surfaces, and translations infrastructure, balancing region-specific execution with long-term platform thinking. You’ll play a key role in delivering reliable, intuitive mobile experiences that make Robinhood successful in global markets.&lt;/p&gt;
