&lt;h3 data-start=&quot;374&quot; data-end=&quot;399&quot;&gt;About the team + role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;401&quot; data-end=&quot;843&quot;&gt;We are building an elite team, applying frontier technologies to the world’s biggest financial problems. We’re looking for bold thinkers. Sharp problem-solvers. Builders who are wired to make an impact. Robinhood isn’t a place for complacency, it’s where ambitious people do the best work of their careers. We’re a high-performing, fast-moving team with ethics at the center of everything we do. Expectations are high, and so are the rewards.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;845&quot; data-end=&quot;1229&quot;&gt;The Android team’s mission is to redefine how millions of users engage with their finances. We&#39;re focused on delivering intuitive, scalable, and inclusive mobile experiences that empower our customers to build better financial futures. We collaborate closely with Product, Design, and Backend Engineering to ensure every interaction on Android reflects quality, performance, and care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot; data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Robinhood’s iRAD team&lt;/strong&gt; builds and scales investing experiences across areas like Retirement, Advisory, Recurring Investments, and Recommendations. The team works across both foundational and customer-facing surfaces, including onboarding flows, settings, deeplinks, and other shared product experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;wnfdntt _1ibi0s3f5 _1ibi0s3ce _1ibi0s3ea&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Android Engineer on iRAD&lt;/strong&gt;, you would build and evolve high-impact mobile experiences across these investing journeys, helping shape how customers discover, open, manage, and grow their accounts on Robinhood. You would lead complex Android work end to end across shared product surfaces and onboarding flows, partner closely with product, design, and backend teams, and make thoughtful technical decisions in areas where safety, scalability, and cross-team compatibility matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1491&quot; data-end=&quot;1596&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our New York City, NY or Menlo Park, CA office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
