&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree (or foreign equivalent) in Design, Communications, Human-Computer Interaction, Journalism, or a related field, and 3 years of experience in the job offered or a related occupation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education and/or experience must include:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic content architecture &amp;amp; systemic governance;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-precision linguistic frameworks for high-stakes transactional interfaces;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced derivatives strategies, leverage, and clearing mechanics;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-volatility incident response and automated financial risk-mitigation flows;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate SEC/FINRA mandates into product implication;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Governance of AI-integrated systems &amp;amp; prompt engineering for algorithmic insights;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic organizational influence &amp;amp; executive stakeholder alignment;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading zero-to-one product launches within a highly regulated fintech environment; and&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing for high-stakes edge cases in financial trading, including assignment/exercise risk, T+1 settlement logic, and complex order-entry mechanics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
