&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with product managers and data scientists to define and execute the Concierge product roadmap, from initial scoping through launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive delivery of complex, zero-to-one product features — including AI-powered financial planning tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguity and product direction changes with clarity and composure, maintaining team focus and momentum through shifting priorities&lt;/li&gt;
