&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Crypto Perpetuals team&lt;/strong&gt; is building Robinhood’s advanced trading experience for customers who want fast, intuitive access to crypto derivatives markets. Our team powers the mobile workflows that help traders monitor price action, understand market depth, manage risk, and place trades with confidence in rapidly moving markets.&lt;/p&gt;
