&lt;li&gt;Manage and optimize monorepo builds using Bazel and own the remote build execution cluster, ensuring fast, stable builds and short feedback loops for our engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scale CI pipelines to support thousands of daily builds, focusing on speed, safety, and reliability, while managing GitHub repository configurations, pre-merge checks, and test executions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the developer onboarding experience, reducing time-to-first-commit and making it easy for new engineers to get productive.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide and maintain remote development environments to accelerate local workflows and ensure developers can code, test, and deploy with minimal friction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
