&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and maintaining developer infrastructure, CI/CD pipelines, or large-scale build systems (such as Bazel).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in writing clean, maintainable code in Go or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with distributed or remote build execution systems, and a solid understanding of containerization and orchestration using Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and a focus on improving developer productivity, onboarding, and engineering workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
