&lt;li&gt;Build foundational platform services, APIs, libraries, and SDKs that make it easier for teams to integrate AI into security workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design secure systems with strong identity, authentication, authorization, encryption, and data protection controls&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate reliable, large-scale distributed systems that support AI-powered security use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop platform capabilities and guardrails that enable teams to safely build and operate AI agents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with security, infrastructure, and engineering teams to understand their needs and translate them into reusable platform capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve platform performance, developer experience, reliability, and security through automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the technical direction and architecture of Robinhood’s AI Security platform as the team and platform continue to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
