&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5946&quot;&gt;Build and run the AWS infrastructure behind custody, key management, and blockchain node operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6048&quot;&gt;Automate infrastructure and configuration management (Ansible, Terraform, or similar) so the team spends less time on manual operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6186&quot;&gt;Run our blockchain nodes across the networks we support, and keep them healthy and available.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6281&quot;&gt;Write and maintain services in Python for infrastructure management and wallet operations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6373&quot;&gt;Own the integrations with third-party custodians.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6424&quot;&gt;Build out Kubernetes and Docker deployments as we containerize more of the custody stack.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6515&quot;&gt;Set up monitoring and alerting (Prometheus, Grafana, or equivalent) so we know about problems before customers do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6631&quot;&gt;Apply security controls and standards throughout — access control, key management, incident response.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
