&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6734&quot;&gt;Provide on-call support, responding to and resolving production issues to keep custody systems reliable and available.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
