&lt;p&gt;The Options Web team builds the web experiences that let customers trade options on Robinhood. The team works across Robinhood.com and Legend, our web trading platform for active traders. Its work covers trading flows, options onboarding for new customers, and monitoring tools. On Legend, the team builds the options pieces, including options details in the positions widget and the Option Chain tool. You&#39;ll work closely with product managers, designers, and the mobile options team, and you&#39;ll see your work reach customers fast!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in our &lt;strong&gt;Menlo Park, CA&lt;/strong&gt; office, with in-person hybrid attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/p&gt;
