&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;2766&quot;&gt;You have strong proficiency in SQL and Python for data analysis and modeling&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
