&lt;p&gt;Bitstamp made history in 2011 as the world’s first regulated crypto exchange. As a key part of the Robinhood family, the &lt;strong&gt;Exchange Platform team&lt;/strong&gt; owns the full service lifecycle. We are the architects of a modern, high-velocity ecosystem that enables our global expansion, ensuring the world’s longest-running exchange remains unshakeable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Backend Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; on the &lt;strong&gt;Exchange Platform team,&lt;/strong&gt; you will define the technical vision, long-term architectural roadmap, and engineering standards for our platform modernization strategy. You will serve as a primary technical leader across the Bitstamp exchange ecosystem—architecting the next generation of cloud infrastructure for mission-critical, low-latency services, driving complex distributed systems integrations, and elevating the technical bar across Robinhood.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our Ljubljana, Slovenia office, with in-person attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
