&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Robinhood Advisor Products team&lt;/strong&gt; is bringing Trade PMR, Robinhood&#39;s newly acquired registered investment advisor platform, into the Robinhood product suite. Our multiyear mission is to connect Robinhood&#39;s growing retail customers with Trade PMR&#39;s financial advisors, while bringing together two sets of technology and user experiences into one coherent product. You&#39;ll work alongside engineers, product managers, and partners in marketing and finance who care about getting this integration right for customers on both sides. We&#39;re energized by the scope of this work and the chance to shape how two strong businesses come together!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Web Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;on this team, you&#39;ll build and scale full-stack systems, spanning backend services and web applications that support Advisors and Investors. You&#39;ll take on system design work, reasoning through tradeoffs to produce architecture that holds up as the integration between Trade PMR and Robinhood grows, and you&#39;ll stay hands-on, writing code while also setting technical direction. You&#39;ll partner with product, marketing, and finance stakeholders to turn open-ended requirements into concrete technical plans, and you&#39;ll coach and review other engineers&#39; work to raise the bar on quality and process across the team. You&#39;ll have an initial focus on integrating &quot;growing good&quot; retail customers with Trade PMR advisors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role is based in our New York, NY office(s), with in-person hybrid attendance expected at least 3 days per week.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Robinhood, we believe in the power of in-person work to accelerate progress, spark innovation, and strengthen community. Our office experience is intentional, energizing, and designed to fully support high-performing teams.&lt;/p&gt;
