&lt;li&gt;Design and build full-stack web systems, backend services and user-facing web applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create system and technical designs that hold up at scale, and reason through tradeoffs with your team before committing to an approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with other engineering teams, product, marketing, and finance stakeholders to turn ambiguous requirements into clear technical plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and review other engineers&#39; work, helping raise the bar on code quality, design rigor, and delivery practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define mechanisms to ensure best practices are applied in our development cycle.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate clearly with technical and non-technical audiences, including customers when needed, about progress and tradeoffs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
